{
  "uid": "ci-tests",
  "title": "CI Tests",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "repo",
        "label": "Repository",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "query_result(group by (repo) (count_over_time(ci_build_duration_seconds[$__range:])))",
        "regex": "/repo=\"([^\"]+)\"/",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "job_type",
        "label": "Job Type",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "query_result(group by (job_name) (count_over_time(ci_junit_test_duration_seconds[$__range:])))",
        "regex": "/job_name=\"([^\"]+)\"/",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "pr_number",
        "label": "PR",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "query_result(group by (pr_number) (count_over_time(ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{job_name=~\"$job_type\",repo=~\"$repo\"}[$__range:])))",
        "regex": "/pr_number=\"([^\"]+)\"/",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 3
      },
      {
        "name": "test_name",
        "label": "Test",
        "description": "Filter by test name substring (e.g. kserve, monitoring)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "test_variant",
        "label": "Test Variant",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "query_result(group by (test_variant) (count_over_time(ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{job_name=~\"$job_type\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",repo=~\"$repo\"}[$__range:])))",
        "regex": "/test_variant=\"([^\"]+)\"/",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 50,
      "title": "Dashboard Guide",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 51,
          "title": "",
          "type": "text",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 6,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 1
          },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "### How to use this dashboard\n\nThis dashboard shows test-case-level results from JUnit XML artifacts.\n\n**Filters:**\n- **Job Type** -- narrow to specific CI jobs.\n- **PR** -- filter to a specific pull request.\n- **Test Variant** -- filter to a specific e2e test variant.\n\n**Panels:**\n- **Row 1 (Health):** at-a-glance test pass rate, unique failing tests, suite duration, and build count.\n- **Row 2 (Trends):** pass rate and suite duration over time.\n- **Row 3 (Breakdown):** most frequently failing tests and slowest tests.\n- **Row 4 (Investigation):** detailed test results table and step failure messages from VictoriaLogs.\n\n**Tips:**\n- Start with the pass rate stat. If it's green, tests are healthy.\n- Check \"Top Failing Tests\" to find flaky or broken tests.\n- Use \"Slowest Tests\" to identify performance regressions.\n- Expand the Investigation row for per-build details."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Health Summary",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Test Pass Rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count_over_time((group by (build_id, test_name) (ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{leaf=\"true\",status=\"passed\",test_name=~\".*$test_name.*\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}))[$__range:])) / count(count_over_time((group by (build_id, test_name) (ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{leaf=\"true\",status=~\"passed|failed\",test_name=~\".*$test_name.*\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}))[$__range:])) * 100",
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 90
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 98
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Unique Failing Tests",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 2
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count by (test_name) (count_over_time((group by (build_id, test_name) (ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{leaf=\"true\",status=\"failed\",test_name=~\".*$test_name.*\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}))[$__range:])))",
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 15
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Avg Suite Duration",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 2
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(max by (build_id) (last_over_time(ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}[$__range])))",
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Builds With Test Data",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 2
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count by (build_id) (last_over_time(ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}[$__range])))",
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "title": "Trends",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "Test Pass Rate Over Time",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count_over_time((group by (build_id, test_name) (ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{leaf=\"true\",status=\"passed\",test_name=~\".*$test_name.*\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}))[$__interval:])) / count(count_over_time((group by (build_id, test_name) (ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{leaf=\"true\",status=~\"passed|failed\",test_name=~\".*$test_name.*\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}))[$__interval:])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Pass Rate",
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "6h"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "title": "Suite Duration Over Time",
      "description": "Test suite execution time per build (min/avg/max).",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(max by (build_id) (last_over_time(ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "Avg",
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "6h"
        },
        {
          "expr": "min(max by (build_id) (last_over_time(ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "Min",
          "refId": "B",
          "interval": "6h"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(max by (build_id) (last_over_time(ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "Max",
          "refId": "C",
          "interval": "6h"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Avg"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "blue",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Min"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "green",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Max"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "red",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "title": "Breakdown",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "title": "Top Failing Tests",
      "description": "Test cases with the most failures across builds.",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(15, count by (test_name) (count_over_time((group by (build_id, test_name) (ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{leaf=\"true\",status=\"failed\",test_name=~\".*$test_name.*\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}))[$__range:])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{test_name}}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          },
          "noValue": "No failing tests",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Filter to this test",
              "url": "/d/ci-tests/ci-tests?var-test_name=${__field.labels.test_name}&var-job_type=${job_type}&var-pr_number=${pr_number}&var-test_variant=${test_variant}&from=${__from}&to=${__to}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "minVizWidth": 0,
        "minVizHeight": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "title": "Slowest Tests",
      "description": "Test cases by average duration across builds.",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(15, avg by (test_name) (last_over_time(ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{leaf=\"true\",test_name=~\".*$test_name.*\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{test_name}}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Filter to this test",
              "url": "/d/ci-tests/ci-tests?var-test_name=${__field.labels.test_name}&var-job_type=${job_type}&var-pr_number=${pr_number}&var-test_variant=${test_variant}&from=${__from}&to=${__to}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "minVizWidth": 0,
        "minVizHeight": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 400,
      "title": "Investigation",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 40,
          "title": "Test Results",
          "description": "Individual test case results with duration and status.",
          "type": "table",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 10,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 27
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "last_over_time(ci_junit_test_duration_seconds{leaf=\"true\",status=\"failed\",test_name=~\".*$test_name.*\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\",test_variant=~\"$test_variant\",repo=~\"$repo\"}[$__range])",
              "format": "table",
              "instant": true,
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "transformations": [
            {
              "id": "organize",
              "options": {
                "excludeByName": {
                  "Time": true,
                  "__name__": true,
                  "branch": true,
                  "author": true,
                  "suite": true,
                  "leaf": true,
                  "job_name": true
                },
                "renameByName": {
                  "test_name": "Test",
                  "status": "Status",
                  "Value": "Duration",
                  "build_id": "Build ID",
                  "pr_number": "PR",
                  "pr_sha": "Commit",
                  "job_name": "Job",
                  "test_variant": "Variant",
                  "org": "org",
                  "repo": "repo"
                },
                "indexByName": {
                  "test_name": 0,
                  "status": 1,
                  "Value": 2,
                  "build_id": 3,
                  "pr_number": 4,
                  "pr_sha": 5,
                  "job_name": 6,
                  "test_variant": 7,
                  "org": 8,
                  "repo": 9
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {},
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "Duration"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "unit",
                    "value": "s"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "custom.width",
                    "value": 80
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "Status"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "custom.width",
                    "value": 75
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "mappings",
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "type": "value",
                        "options": {
                          "passed": {
                            "text": "Passed",
                            "color": "green"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "value",
                        "options": {
                          "failed": {
                            "text": "Failed",
                            "color": "red"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "value",
                        "options": {
                          "skipped": {
                            "text": "Skipped",
                            "color": "yellow"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "PR"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "custom.width",
                    "value": 80
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "links",
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "title": "GitHub PR",
                        "url": "https://github.com/${__data.fields.org}/${__data.fields.repo}/pull/${__value.raw}",
                        "targetBlank": true
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "Build ID"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "custom.width",
                    "value": 175
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "links",
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "title": "Prow Job",
                        "url": "https://prow.ci.openshift.org/view/gs/test-platform-results/pr-logs/pull/${__data.fields.org}_${__data.fields.repo}/${__data.fields.PR}/${__data.fields.Job}/${__value.raw}",
                        "targetBlank": true
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "Commit"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "custom.width",
                    "value": 115
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "org"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "custom.hidden",
                    "value": true
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "repo"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "custom.hidden",
                    "value": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {
            "sortBy": [
              {
                "displayName": "Duration",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "title": "Step Failure Messages",
          "description": "Step-level failure messages from JUnit XML.",
          "type": "logs",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 12,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 37
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "repo:~\"${repo:pipe}\" AND source:junit_step AND status:failed AND pr_number:~\"${pr_number:pipe}\"",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "showTime": true,
            "showLabels": true,
            "wrapLogMessage": true,
            "enableLogDetails": true,
            "sortOrder": "Descending"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39
}
